    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. what about protecting us from \"bad faith\" actors or people trying to hide things in the fine print? like, how do we make sure they aren't hiding extra fees or manipulating the delivery schedules behind our backs? any specific clauses to prevent that kind of sneaky behavior?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
